<https://w3id.org/crima-ontology/ccore#EcosystemService> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> "Haines-Young, R., & Potschin, M. (2010). The links between biodiversity, ecosystem services and human well-being. Ecosystem Ecology: a new synthesis, 1, 110-139." .
<https://w3id.org/crima-ontology/ccore#Hazard> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The potential occurrence of a natural or human-induced physical event or trend that may cause loss of life, injury, or other health impacts, as well as damage and loss to property, infrastructure, livelihoods, service provision, ecosystems and environmental resources. See also Impacts (consequences, outcomes) and Risk." .
