<https://w3id.org/crima-ontology/ccore#EcosystemService> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "EcosystemService is the benefit/outcome that natural ecosystems provide to humans, such as health and well-being, and then is useful for humans due to its value. EcosystemService is included in the ecosystem service (ESs) cascade." .
